flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Declare sleepTime]

    B --> C{Already in sleep mode}

    C -- Yes --> D([Return])

    C -- No --> E[Set inSleepMode true]
    E --> F[Print auxiliary sleep minutes]

    F --> G[Set sleepTime to default sleep minutes]

    G --> H{Aux sleep minutes greater than zero}

    H -- Yes --> I[Set sleepTime to aux sleep minutes]

    H -- No --> J{Debug switch HIGH or debug flag active}

    J -- Yes --> K[Set sleepTime to 1 minute]

    J -- No --> L[Keep default sleepTime]

    I --> M[Print entering sleep message]
    K --> M
    L --> M

    M --> N[Enable OLED power save mode]
    N --> O[Set OLED active flag false]

    O --> P[Power off DS2484]
    P --> Q[Delay 10 ms]

    Q --> R[Set justWokeUp flag true]
    R --> S[Reset allReadingsSent flag]

    S --> T[Enable GPIO 2 EXT0 wakeup]
    T --> U[Enable timer wakeup]
    U --> V[Start deep sleep]

    V --> W([End])
